Document agent mail: with this build's agent-status hooks, mail sent to a pane running Claude Code or Codex reaches the
agent by itself through `ngtermctl agent mail`, which the hooks run; whose mail an agent follows is its instructions'
call. Applied after 0019-agent-upload.patch.

